# Phone layout

- Phone canvas width: **360px**
- Side padding (when used): **20px** each side
- Content width: **320px** (`360 − 20 − 20`)

Do not invent other horizontal insets for the phone frame. Full-bleed elements (header, footer, sheets) may span 360; padded body content stays within 320.
